This project modifies the Memories go-vod transcoder.
Upstream: https://github.com/pulsejet/memories
Baseline: Memories v11.0.2 / e156f850ec5514433f1cfac9d4f1dbd461500c8d
Protocol: go-vod 0.7.0
The upstream Apache License 2.0 is retained in LICENSE and go-vod/LICENSE.

Hardware support comes from Rockchip MPP/RGA and the FFmpeg work shipped in
Jellyfin FFmpeg, including nyanmisaka/ffmpeg-rockchip.
https://github.com/jellyfin/jellyfin-ffmpeg
https://github.com/nyanmisaka/ffmpeg-rockchip
FFmpeg and bundled libraries retain their respective licenses. The runtime
includes the pinned FFmpeg and Mali copyright files and Rockchip MPP licenses.

The memories_rkmpp_v11 browser helper is licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later.
Its license is included in memories_rkmpp_v11/LICENSE.
